      "source": "The bean name of the configuration properties validator.",
      "translation": "配置属性验证器的 Bean 名称。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Enable support for <a href=\"ConfigurationProperties.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>@ConfigurationProperties</code></a> annotated\nbeans. <code>@ConfigurationProperties</code> beans can be registered in the standard way\n(for example using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a> methods) or, for convenience, can be specified\ndirectly on this annotation.",
      "translation": "启用对带有 <a href=\"ConfigurationProperties.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>@ConfigurationProperties</code></a> 注解的 bean 的支持。<code>@ConfigurationProperties</code> bean 可以以标准方式注册（例如使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a> 方法），或者为了方便起见，可以直接在此注解上指定。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convenient way to quickly register\n<a href=\"ConfigurationProperties.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>@ConfigurationProperties</code></a> annotated beans with\nSpring.",
      "translation": "快速注册带有 <a href=\"ConfigurationProperties.html\" title=\"org.springframework.boot.context.properties 中的注解接口\"><code>@ConfigurationProperties</code></a> 的 Bean 的便捷方式与 Spring。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convenient way to quickly register\n<a href=\"ConfigurationProperties.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>@ConfigurationProperties</code></a> annotated beans with\nSpring. Standard Spring Beans will also be scanned regardless of this value.",
      "translation": "快速注册带有 <a href=\"ConfigurationProperties.html\" title=\"org.springframework.boot.context.properties 中的注解接口\"><code>@ConfigurationProperties</code></a> 的 Bean 的便捷方式。无论此值如何，标准 Spring Bean 也会被扫描。",
      "count": 2
    },
